window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>FIRE. BLOOD. CHAOS.</p> <p>Fiaa, the newly crowned Queen of Faerie is left with the destruction Sintus and the Darkens caused in their wake.</p> <p>Ryker, the King of Faerie finds himself in the clutches of their enemies, as Fiaa is left to defend their kingdom alone.</p> <p>Faerie and Faedom have already lost so much, can Fiaa end Sintus’s reign of tyranny?</p> <p>Can the realms become whole as those who fight against the Darken come together?</p> <p>Secrets crumble their history. Betrayal is thick in the air.</p> <p>Time is running out.</p> <p>Will Fiaa be able to save her mate, save Faerie and bring the realms together?</p> <p><i>Broken Kingdom is the last instalment of the Fox Fire trilogy.</i></p>"; 
